## 2. Exact Response JSON

### Field-by-Field Breakdown (`GET /api/financial-state`)

| Field Name | Type | Required | Nullable | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `user_id` | `string` | Yes | No | Unique user identifier (e.g., `"meera_001"`) |
| `pots` | `object` | Yes | No | Money Pot Map balance object |
| `pots.cash` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Unlocked cash in hand (e.g., `2000`) |
| `pots.bank` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Bank balance (e.g., `5000`) |
| `pots.shg` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Self-Help Group savings (e.g., `2500`) |
| `pots.chit_committed` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Chit fund committed amount (e.g., `4000`) |
| `pots.post_office` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Post Office / Sukanya / RD savings (e.g., `5000`) |
| `pots.business` | `number` (float) | Optional | No | Informal business pot balance (e.g., `0` or profit added) |
| `total_balance` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Dynamic mathematical sum of all active pots (e.g., `18500`) |
| `business` | `object` | Yes | No | Informal micro-enterprise state |
| `business.activity` | `string` | Yes | No | Business description (e.g., `"pickle sales + tailoring"`) |
| `business.last_entry` | `object` | Yes | No | Most recent transaction breakdown |
| `business.last_entry.revenue` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Revenue generated (e.g., `1000`) |
| `business.last_entry.cost` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Operating costs incurred (e.g., `600`) |
| `business.last_entry.profit` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Calculated net profit: `revenue - cost` (e.g., `400`) |
| `goal` | `object` | Yes | No | Active financial goal state |
| `goal.name` | `string` | Yes | No | Goal name (e.g., `"Education"`) |
| `goal.target` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Goal target amount (e.g., `20000`) |
| `goal.saved` | `number` (float) | Yes | No | Amount saved toward goal so far (e.g., `8000`) |
| `recent_transactions` | `array` | Yes | No | List of recent transaction records (can be `[]`) |
| `updated_at` | `string` (ISO 8601) | Yes | No | Last update timestamp (e.g., `"2026-09-18T14:36:00.000Z"`) |
| `_meta` | `object` | Yes | No | Non-functional metadata (`pots_count`, `discrepancy_note`) |

